{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Wizard alone in a shattered world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey across Tempus, a world of floating islands flora and fauna. You are a lonely wizard, once a caretaker of the temporal flows, now retired and hoping for the world to return to what it once was. With no purpose left a call to action comes from a small rock critter, crying for help as it finds itself far from home and lost in the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your magic to guide the critter and it's family home while you traverse hostile terrain, solve puzzles, fight vegetative enemies and find secrets in this charming student-made action adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And if you don't want to save the critters... There's always the alternative..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/e9b68aa7fc6eb858b9a3917df3756863.poster.avif?t=1765810914\" width=866 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/e9b68aa7fc6eb858b9a3917df3756863.webm?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/e9b68aa7fc6eb858b9a3917df3756863.mp4?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the world of Tempus, magic is not free. Every action has consequence and as such you must be careful when harnessing the energy of your surroundings to fuel spellcasting. Carelessness will limit your options and you may just find yourself in a pickle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On the flipside, move\u00a0 without haste and the friends you make along the way might lend you a hand or crystal to aid your spell slinging adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/0d2c3ca0d0ad962eb351cfe7d6dd61d9.poster.avif?t=1765810914\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/0d2c3ca0d0ad962eb351cfe7d6dd61d9.webm?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/0d2c3ca0d0ad962eb351cfe7d6dd61d9.mp4?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Reactive world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With only a simple projectile TEMPUS aims to provide some engaging moments and fun interactions through handcrafted challenges, puzzles and environments. Take your time to explore a small world and journey through the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Blast a companion, hug a &quot;friend&quot;, the world will carry on without you in the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/b105d14209eba92b855393eb2b72d739.poster.avif?t=1765810914\" width=1016 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/b105d14209eba92b855393eb2b72d739.webm?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/b105d14209eba92b855393eb2b72d739.mp4?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While the main story is short, we've made sure to include several achievements and secrets for curious players to find and hopefully enjoy, give it a whirl if you dare, take a leap of faith and don't trust a flower by it's petals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thank you for playing!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Wizard Awakes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/fd411ba51038bc01e89ad9638acb3270da6f1384.jpg"},{"name":"Shield Hack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/f27efd7b8b9d6187ab9dad23e2060f62c8467f5c.jpg"},{"name":"Evil Incarnate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/d5dd5dcd6414d311dba6c829a369dc65fe31f2c1.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Floater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/41033541acdaadcf9f6015e3389ded98faed4a22.jpg"},{"name":"Hat-Trick of rocks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/0efb14c7f81e803bc106be8b48473b996466ad0e.jpg"},{"name":"Half a dozen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/9868e3054f27165c3337ba9c3dba112e521c2a0f.jpg"},{"name":"A decade of critters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/070d50d7c1e50763b0d7324ee6fe2c436189be39.jpg"},{"name":"A dozen & a pair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/59642a367f06655312b90f459b957884d8029806.jpg"},{"name":"Credits Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/9716b3ba9ecbb7d58304d8799c6f5410b6baabbd.jpg"},{"name":"Hell Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018430/0ec0e96a51acc3fcc2c021d0baee2e4bba6040b5.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018430?t=1765810914","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018430?t=1765810914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/fd74d2efb36c88dca5b7e89213068567c7e6325b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765810914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/fd74d2efb36c88dca5b7e89213068567c7e6325b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765810914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Wizard alone in a shattered world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey across Tempus, a world of floating islands flora and fauna. You are a lonely wizard, once a caretaker of the temporal flows, now retired and hoping for the world to return to what it once was. With no purpose left a call to action comes from a small rock critter, crying for help as it finds itself far from home and lost in the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your magic to guide the critter and it's family home while you traverse hostile terrain, solve puzzles, fight vegetative enemies and find secrets in this charming student-made action adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And if you don't want to save the critters... There's always the alternative..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/e9b68aa7fc6eb858b9a3917df3756863.poster.avif?t=1765810914\" width=866 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/e9b68aa7fc6eb858b9a3917df3756863.webm?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/e9b68aa7fc6eb858b9a3917df3756863.mp4?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the world of Tempus, magic is not free. Every action has consequence and as such you must be careful when harnessing the energy of your surroundings to fuel spellcasting. Carelessness will limit your options and you may just find yourself in a pickle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On the flipside, move\u00a0 without haste and the friends you make along the way might lend you a hand or crystal to aid your spell slinging adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/0d2c3ca0d0ad962eb351cfe7d6dd61d9.poster.avif?t=1765810914\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/0d2c3ca0d0ad962eb351cfe7d6dd61d9.webm?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/0d2c3ca0d0ad962eb351cfe7d6dd61d9.mp4?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Reactive world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With only a simple projectile TEMPUS aims to provide some engaging moments and fun interactions through handcrafted challenges, puzzles and environments. Take your time to explore a small world and journey through the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Blast a companion, hug a &quot;friend&quot;, the world will carry on without you in the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/b105d14209eba92b855393eb2b72d739.poster.avif?t=1765810914\" width=1016 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/b105d14209eba92b855393eb2b72d739.webm?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/extras/b105d14209eba92b855393eb2b72d739.mp4?t=1765810914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While the main story is short, we've made sure to include several achievements and secrets for curious players to find and hopefully enjoy, give it a whirl if you dare, take a leap of faith and don't trust a flower by it's petals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thank you for playing!</p>","developers":["Propeller Cap Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018430/f0a6b47332bdaa5f1299a2247dd6e016693ed995/header.jpg?t=1765810914","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 980<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\